Subject: [PATCH 013/190] dt-bindings: interrupt-controller: Convert Xilinx
 INTC binding

commit 96f24cc74d5bb8fb2d4d8fee6f2a9f69788151d9 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

